Step 2: Troubleshooting & Resolving Initial Runner Failure
Issue: During the initial push (d9ef85a), the # TODO: comments remained in place on the run: keys, causing YAML to parse those values as null and triggering a Combined status: failure on PR #1.

Resolution: Replaced the # TODO: markers with ruff check src tests and pytest tests/ -v, committed the fix (6d6bd5e), and pushed to origin/add-ci, automatically re-triggering the Gitea Actions runner checks.

